  "description": "Detailed & Immersive SteamPunk Theme Modpack w/ 1000+ Quests!",
  "body": "![Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/33da70f2ef4b15fd16a7b4bcc503002312d532fe.png)\n\n![In all-caps bold text, the word \"FEATURES\". ](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/785d3640a720d7e56cba3a6e2bbcdc37f34cf7e1.png)\n\n⚙️ Full parity with [Curseforge Version](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/steam-punk)\n\n⚙️ Create Rise and Shine Update w/ Addons\n\n⚙️ Amazing NEW World Generation and Biomes\n\n⚙️ Incredible detailed Structures and Dungeons to Explore\n\n⚙️ Completely NEW Stronghold and Fortress\n\n⚙️ Overhauled Villages, Structures & Dungeons\n\n⚙️ Never seen before NEW Bosses & Steam Mobs\n\n⚙️ 5 NEW Dimensions & 5 NEW Planets to Explore!\n\n⚙️ Skills, Magic, Tetra & most importantly Steam like Tech\n\n⚙️ NEW Game Mechanics such as Thin Air & Cold Sweat\n\n⚙️ NEW Game Features such as Tempad, Improvable Skills, & Guns\n\n⚙️ 1000+ Detailed Quests to help Guide you & 1000+ Advancements!\n\n[![Live count of how many members are online in the Luna Pixel Studios discord server.](https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white)](https://lunapixel.studio/discord)\n[![Use code LUNAPIXEL for 25% off Bisect Hosting](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2c3d1af34a17cb45f2ba4b9cfca4bd54d1c857ef.png)](https://lunapixel.studio/bisect)\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/uYaI_AbLyWw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VtcmVameArU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
